<title>AUSTRALIA: Amcor reorganises divisions,sees job cuts.</title>
<headline>Amcor reorganises divisions,sees job cuts.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian paper and packaging group Amcor Ltd said on Thursday it would re-organise its divisional structure to position the group for a return to profitable growth as soon as possible.</p>
<p>Amcor said in a letter to shareholders it would create the Amcor Printing Papers Group to include the fine papers business, the Gippsland operations of Amcor Paper and Amcor Merchanting and Trading.</p>
